								<ul>
									<li class="tag label category"><!--wovn-src:高周波基板-->Copper-clad laminates</li><li class="tag label category"><!--wovn-src:高周波タイプ-->High Frequency Type</li>									<li class="tag label normal"><!--wovn-src:UL規格-->UL Standard</li><li class="tag label normal"><!--wovn-src:ROHS対応-->ROHS Directive</li>								</ul>
