														<h3><!--wovn-src:特長-->Features</h3>							<div class="txt">
									<p><!--wovn-src:●ＣＧＰに比べ誘電率をさらに低くした基板です。-->●This substrate has an even lower dielectric constant than CGP.<br><!--wovn-src:
●比誘電率は2.15です。-->●The dielectric constant is 2.15.</p>
